---
_version: 0
# ADR-0115: written once, before Lyrion's first start, and Lyrion's from then
# on. The device's own Music folder, and its Playlists folder - which Debian's
# build of Lyrion leaves unset, so it could not save a playlist at all.
mediadirs:
  - /var/lib/gexis-music
playlistdir: /var/lib/gexis-music/Playlists
# George, 2026-10-03: no setup wizard - its plugin list would let Material Skin
# be unticked. Material is made the skin by the core once it is installed:
# named here before it is there, Lyrion drew a page with no skin at all.
wizardDone: 1
